{"3617560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Buck Trucker in Rowdy Business", "steam_appid": 3617560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3617680], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUCK TRUCKER'S ADVENTURE BEGINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/6ca9967a41ea8326926265556c130a63.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/6ca9967a41ea8326926265556c130a63.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/6ca9967a41ea8326926265556c130a63.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YEEE HAW! Buckle up for the first installment of the Buck Trucker adventures! Follow the outrageous exploits of Buck Trucker as he heads to the Golden Palm Casino - Las Vegas, Nevada with one mission: save the orphanage back home in Clay County, West Virginia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buck Trucker in Rowdy Business delivers a quick-hittin' replayable romp, perfect for anyone who wants the text adventure experience, without the complexity and length.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;GAMES. GAMES. GAMES. WINNERS AND LOSERS&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/3eb1c5a0dd10afbcc7516bc61381725c.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/3eb1c5a0dd10afbcc7516bc61381725c.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/3eb1c5a0dd10afbcc7516bc61381725c.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put Buck's gambling skills to the test with realistic casino games! Try your luck at the blackjack table, pull the lever on the Lucky Tug Slot Machine, or place your bets at the horse racing track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dollar counts when you're savin’ them orphans... or does Buck have other plans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, cowboy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET CRAZY CHARACTERS ALONG THE WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/e0d8e380c419647fb503a01c182e3301.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/e0d8e380c419647fb503a01c182e3301.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/e0d8e380c419647fb503a01c182e3301.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with a cast of Vegas lowlifes, high rollers, and everyone in between. Help Buck make   decisions that will lead to wildly different outcomes - will Buck save them orphans, find true love, or end up in a dumpster behind the Golden Palm Casino?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story through hand-crafted character portraits and scenes that bring Buck's rowdy adventures to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/b2d3cd2d16a22df612c5dd70cf81ada2.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/b2d3cd2d16a22df612c5dd70cf81ada2.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/b2d3cd2d16a22df612c5dd70cf81ada2.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you got what it takes to be a real Trucker? Unlock 20 achievements that'll have you exploring every seedy corner of the Golden Palm Casino. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover all possible endings? Can you maintain a clean conscience in a city of sin? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is, which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUCK TRUCKER'S ADVENTURE BEGINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/6ca9967a41ea8326926265556c130a63.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/6ca9967a41ea8326926265556c130a63.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/6ca9967a41ea8326926265556c130a63.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YEEE HAW! Buckle up for the first installment of the Buck Trucker adventures! Follow the outrageous exploits of Buck Trucker as he heads to the Golden Palm Casino - Las Vegas, Nevada with one mission: save the orphanage back home in Clay County, West Virginia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buck Trucker in Rowdy Business delivers a quick-hittin' replayable romp, perfect for anyone who wants the text adventure experience, without the complexity and length.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;GAMES. GAMES. GAMES. WINNERS AND LOSERS&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/3eb1c5a0dd10afbcc7516bc61381725c.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/3eb1c5a0dd10afbcc7516bc61381725c.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/3eb1c5a0dd10afbcc7516bc61381725c.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put Buck's gambling skills to the test with realistic casino games! Try your luck at the blackjack table, pull the lever on the Lucky Tug Slot Machine, or place your bets at the horse racing track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dollar counts when you're savin’ them orphans... or does Buck have other plans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, cowboy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET CRAZY CHARACTERS ALONG THE WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/e0d8e380c419647fb503a01c182e3301.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/e0d8e380c419647fb503a01c182e3301.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/e0d8e380c419647fb503a01c182e3301.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with a cast of Vegas lowlifes, high rollers, and everyone in between. Help Buck make   decisions that will lead to wildly different outcomes - will Buck save them orphans, find true love, or end up in a dumpster behind the Golden Palm Casino?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story through hand-crafted character portraits and scenes that bring Buck's rowdy adventures to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/b2d3cd2d16a22df612c5dd70cf81ada2.poster.avif?t=1749808934\" width=660 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/b2d3cd2d16a22df612c5dd70cf81ada2.webm?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/extras/b2d3cd2d16a22df612c5dd70cf81ada2.mp4?t=1749808934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you got what it takes to be a real Trucker? Unlock 20 achievements that'll have you exploring every seedy corner of the Golden Palm Casino. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover all possible endings? Can you maintain a clean conscience in a city of sin? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is, which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Buck Trucker must gamble and sweet-talk his way through The Golden Palm Casino, Las Vegas, to save an orphanage back home—or succumb to Sin City's many temptations in this choice-driven story featuring mini-games, multiple endings, and a cast of outlandish characters.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/b9725557af99649e9835ddb95b52b5a4c76e8002/header.jpg?t=1749808934", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617560/98cc6d2cb921c3a3c25dce8fa9ae2ee9